{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_title", "source_sha256": "f0ac1d1d9f81bac7bf49422e5430e339c583ba0b2cf3c13a72e9e04c2ca6ec65", "ja": "秋田に来たなら", "zh": "既然来到了秋田", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6d7681b22262fd75c547426714f5357fdacc6ad2374e9e9d501522cfbc0929cd", "ja": "囲炉裏を囲んで、秋田グルメに舌鼓を打つ\nひなた、エレナ、律子、ロコ。ナマハゲも見\nたかったと言うロコのために真似をしてみせ\nるプロデューサー。ひなたも絶賛する名演に\nみんなからアンコールが飛んだ。", "zh": "围坐在地炉旁，尽情品尝秋田美食的\n日向、艾莲娜、律子和ROCO。面对说着也想见\n见生剥鬼的ROCO，制作人当场模仿了\n起来。日向也大加赞赏的精湛演技，\n引得大家纷纷喊起了安可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "51c6453e11fb5c89e606e8c002587838424824b1456c6f4de50cc1b29c5e8e65", "ja": "（古民家を改造したお店で、秋田グルメを満喫！\n囲炉裏を囲んでの食事は格別だな……）", "zh": "（在由古民居改造的店里尽享秋田美食！围着地炉吃饭，真是别有一番风味……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "0220e6454f440d6c214587e503bccb28244121a61bfd4c3ba80f917a13e35dbf", "ja": "煮えたみたいだねぇ。みんな、\nきりたんぽ鍋、もう食べられるよぉ。", "zh": "好像煮好了呢～大家，  \n可以吃烤米棒火锅了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "41573db7eb105d3042ed265b97fc835ab6ef4d21bdb7649cfc5073c9ccf54274", "ja": "ん～！　おいしい～♪　ブラジルの串はお肉だけど、\n日本は串にご飯をつけるよネ。お団子とか！", "zh": "嗯～！好好吃～♪巴西的串是肉串，不过日本会在串上串米饭呢。比如团子之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "93e531d24783aed331eca6a7a6bfd5e1600a1bdb29fa2bada1e7658638e47e45", "ja": "ブラジルはシュラスコが有名だものね。\nなるほど、日本の郷土料理はお米って事かしら？", "zh": "巴西的烤肉串很有名嘛。原来如此，日本的乡土料理就是米饭吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "27bdc8f72b84b78abd7897cb4ddde92f64b924e4316c4304cd39de94e8a9547e", "ja": "このトラディショナルハウスも、インタレストです！\nナマハゲにもエンカウントしたいんですけど……。", "zh": "这座传统民居也很有趣！\n虽然我也想偶遇生剥鬼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "d4be4ca8b923611adeb8e62fbcb4e38ba6662218278dbb7d972eb2a66c2d4053", "ja": "なまはげは、怠け者や悪い子のところに来るからねぇ。\nきっと、ロコちゃんのところには来ないべさ。", "zh": "因为生剥鬼会去找懒惰的人和坏孩子嘛。\n所以，它肯定不会来ROCO这里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "171f5e7a7a54ace422e82a26a3d0828c9a2ebb5e3398d79df240e075ac45ba57", "ja": "みんな、全力でライブを頑張った後だしね……\n残念ながら、ここには来てくれそうにないかも？", "zh": "大家刚刚都在演唱会上全力以赴了嘛……  \n很遗憾，它们好像不会来这里了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "00dea27f253a38cda6d5f24d24d2df3f9916ae990d4f2f0e70fb68e10fe71ca7", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな～……。あのビジュアルと\nキャラクター、ぜひ体験したかったです……。", "zh": "诶诶！？怎么会这样～……我还特别想亲身体验一下那种外表和性格呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "d1761caf1d8637e7478b32584edc452cce47686b645065d9f291492221bc36c8", "ja": "ワタシも会いたかったヨ～……。\nお祭りとかに行けば、会えるのかナ？", "zh": "我也想见见呢～……要是去参加祭典之类的活动，会不会就能见到了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "de2cb8ad37d65f093e39770fee39cd8d4d0c68708dbbd423f8b2872737655834", "ja": "そ、そんなに会いたいのか……？　雰囲気だけで\n言えば……『わるいごはいねが～！』って感じの……。", "zh": "你、你就那么想见吗……？光看气氛的话……就是那种会喊“有没有坏孩子——！”的感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3f6e5e8756adbf960672fdc902235028661e420ea04d5b2ac5ef88645b37148", "ja": "わあ、上手だねぇ{$P$}。\nあたしが昔見たなまはげと、そっくりだったべさ。", "zh": "哇，模仿得真像呀{$P$}。\n和我以前见过的生剥鬼一模一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "f21dd240a3645b863e8b3ff1b14b59d2eb3733042f6b31d1aa0c804f0f2a1031", "ja": "ヒナタ、本当ですか！？　{$P$}、\n今のパフォーマンス、もう一回お願いします！", "zh": "日向，真的吗！？{$P$}，刚才的表演，请再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "c35ffbdf77ace6b81405d09ac33fc28e2daa3ef497e1a95f3cb402890b98937a", "ja": "出刃包丁はないから……このお玉とか持つと、\n雰囲気出るんじゃないですか？　うん、いい感じ♪", "zh": "因为没有出刃包丁……拿着这个汤勺之类的，应该就能营造出那种氛围了吧？嗯，感觉不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d5b30fce55b631e6829245a9dd0c6a9bbe9210a2415cc0fc0cbc51bf20ef7be3", "ja": "よ、よし。こんな感じで再現できてるかな……？\n『わるいごはいねが～！！！』", "zh": "好、好吧。这样算还原出来了吗……？\n“有不听话的坏孩子吗～！！！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "851e4a62f9c36317241361b5c83df0a43757753be4ffa2a8c63e5bab7fd3dfa1", "ja": "アハハ♪　なまはげってこんな感じなんだネ！\n想像より、かわいかったかも！", "zh": "啊哈哈♪ 原来生剥是这种感觉呀！\n好像比想象中还要可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_area04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f69b8bef7917c44c0ad64d37393f2191bd3c41efd61388dccbfab2b6be45e0b9", "ja": "（……その後、本物のなまはげがやってきて、その場は\n大騒ぎになった。……貴重な体験だったな、みんな！）", "zh": "（……后来，真正的生剥鬼来了，现场顿时乱成了一团。……真是一次难得的体验啊，大家！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
